        "VOCAB|||Conflict & Support|||Useful verbs for social resolution:\n\n*   **Talk it out** - Resolve a problem by talking about it.\n*   **Make up** - Re-establish friendly relations after an argument.\n*   **Clear the air** - Defuse tension by discussing differences.\n*   **Through thick and thin** - Support someone in good times and bad.|||Elo: Are you someone who likes to 'talk it out' immediately, or do you need space?",
