        "VOCAB|||Industry & Production|||Key terms for the modern music economy:\n\n*   **Royalties** - Payments made to artists for the use of their music.\n*   **To stream / Streaming** - Transmit data as a continuous flow over the internet.\n*   **Track** - A single song or recording.\n*   **Producer** - The person who oversees and manages the recording of music.|||Elo: Do you think streaming services pay artists enough royalties?",
